      },
      "message": "fix(build): pin test fixtures and post goldens to LF line endings\n\nGit for Windows checks out text files with CRLF by default.\nPin golden files, machine files, model fixtures, skills, and workflows to LF in .gitattributes.\nNormalize line endings for fig8.step.\nAdd tests in xtask to assert the LF line ending attribute and verify checkout with core.autocrlf=true.\n\nFixes #2840",
