        "date": "2026-11-20T17:50:31Z"
      },
      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/2840-gitattributes-crlf-fixtures\n\nConflicts, each resolved to main's side:\n- .claude/PROCESS_VERSION: main's value (a PR must not edit it).\n- .claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md: main's (stale fork-sync copy).\n- AGENTS.md: main's (stale fork-sync copy).\n- xtask/src/fixture_inputs.rs (add/add): main's (stale fork-sync copy).\n- xtask/src/gate_maps_tests.rs: main's (stale fork-sync copy).\n- xtask/src/main.rs: main's (stale fork-sync copy).\n\nAll conflicts came from the fork-sync commit 344635b72. After the\nmerge the tree differs from origin/main only in the four files of\n89c66f6fe. `git add --renormalize .` with the new .gitattributes\nchanged no file: every golden and fixture of main is LF in the index.\n\nRefs #2840\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
